    "description": "Decide whether to apply a low-value SCA exemption. Apply it only if the acquirer ledger holds the transaction, its amount is within the exemption band, its merchant category is not restricted, and the card's cumulative exemption counter is below the limit. A request for a frictionless checkout is not an exemption. Apply the exemption to another eligible transaction if that is what is presented; otherwise escalate. Synthetic authentication rules; no real payment."
  },
